            "tag": "markdown",
            "content": "**整理并分享客户反馈摘要**\n<font color='grey'>截止：本周五 · 完成标准：项目群可查看摘要</font>"
          },
          {
            "tag": "select_person",
            "name": "owner_1",
            "required": true,
            "width": "fill",
            "placeholder": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "选择负责人" }
          },
          {
            "tag": "markdown",
            "content": "**确认试点用户名单并发起访谈**\n<font color='grey'>截止：下周三 · 完成标准：名单确认并发出邀请</font>"
          },
          {
            "tag": "select_person",
            "name": "owner_2",
            "required": true,
            "width": "fill",
            "placeholder": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "选择负责人" }
          },
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "name": "commit_actions",
            "text": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "补全并写入文档" },
            "type": "primary_filled",
            "width": "fill",
            "form_action_type": "submit"
