      },
      {
        "tag": "button",
        "text": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "查看关联文档" },
        "type": "default",
        "width": "fill",
        "behaviors": [
          { "type": "open_url", "default_url": "__DOC_URL__" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "text_size": "caption",
        "content": "<font color='grey'>这次学到：任务最好同时包含负责人、截止时间和完成标准。</font>"
      }
    ]
